[64.396383, "o", "West of House\r\u001b[37d"]
[64.396562, "o", "You are standing in an open field west of a white house, with a boarded front door.\r\u001b[38d"]
[64.396738, "o", "There is a small mailbox here.\r\u001b[40d>"]
