[923.213605, "o", "I won't run as root!\r\n\u001b(B\u001b)0\u001b[?1049h\u001b[1;24r\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[4l\u001b[?1h\u001b=\u001b[H\u001b[J\u001b[0;7m\u000f West of House                                    Score: 0        Moves: 0      \u001b[14;1H\u001b[m\u000fZORK I: The Great Underground Empire\r\u001b[15dCopyright (c) 1981, 1982, 1983 Infocom, Inc. All rights reserved.\r\u001b[16dZORK is a registered trademark of Infocom, Inc.\r\u001b[17dRevision 88 / Serial number 840726\r\u001b[19dWest of House\r\u001b[20dYou are standing in an open field west of a white house, with a boarded front\r\u001b[21ddoor.\r\u001b[22dThere is a small mailbox here.\r\u001b[24d>\b>open mailbox\r\u001b[2d\u001b[3M\u001bM\u001b[74G\u001b[0;7m\u000f1\r\u001b[22d\u001b[m\u000fOpening the small mailbox reveals a leaflet.\r\u001b[24d>\b>take leaflet\r\u001b[2d\u001b[3M\u001bM\u001b[74G\u001b[0;7m\u000f2\r\u001b[22d\u001b[m\u000fTaken.\r\u001b[24d>\b>look\r\u001b[2d\u001b[6M\u001bM\u001b[74G\u001b[0;7m\u000f3\r\u001b[19d\u001b[m\u000fWest of House\r\u001b[20dYou are standing in an open field west of a white house, with a boarded front\r\u001b[21ddoor.\r\u001b[22dThere is a small mailbox here.\r\u001b[24d>\b>east\r\u001b[2d\u001b[3M\u001bM\u001b[74G\u001b[0;7m\u000f4\r\u001b[22d\u001b[m\u000fThe door is boarded and you can't remove the boards.\r\u001b[24d>\b>look\r\u001b[2d\u001b[6M\u001bM\u001b[74G\u001b[0;7m\u000f5\r\u001b[19d\u001b[m\u000fWest of House\r\u001b[20dYou are standing in an open field west of a white house, with a boarded front\r\u001b[21ddoor.\r\u001b[22dThere is a small mailbox here.\r\u001b[24d>\b>open window\r\u001b[2d\u001b[3M\u001bM\u001b[74G\u001b[0;7m\u000f6\r\u001b[22d\u001b[m\u000fYou can't see any window here!\r\u001b[24d>\b>look\r\u001b[2d\u001b[6M\u001bM\u001b[74G\u001b[0;7m\u000f7\r\u001b[19d\u001b[m\u000fWest of House\r\u001b[20dYou are standing in an open field west of a white house, with a boarded front\r\u001b[21ddoor.\r\u001b[22dThere is a small mailbox here.\r\u001b[24d>\b>enter\r\u001b[2d\u001b[3M\u001bM\u001b[74G\u001b[0;7m\u000f8\r\u001b[22d\u001b[m\u000fYou can't go that way.\r\u001b[24d>\b>look\r\u001b[2d\u001b[6M\u001bM\u001b[74G\u001b[0;7m\u000f9\r\u001b[19d\u001b[m\u000fWest of House\r\u001b[20dYou are standing in an open field west of a white house, with a boarded front\r\u001b[21ddoor.\r\u001b[22dThere is a small mailbox here.\r\u001b[24d>\b\u001b[24;1H\u001b[?1049l\r\u001b[?1l\u001b>"]
